# Archival Vision Engine (`archival-vision`)

Governs deterministic image restoration, paleographical transcription, table lattice slicing, and closed-loop visual quality gates for degraded 19th-century census schedules, parish registers, and civil microfilms under **ADR-GEN-019**, **ADR-GEN-020**, and **SOP-GEN-008**.

